      <text xml:space="preserve">{{wiktionary}}
'''User''' can refer to:

* [[User (telecommunications)]]
* [[User (computing)]]
* [[USER]], a recording artist
* A user of a product, see [[consumer]]
* A [[drug abuse|drug user]]

