      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>dab</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[telecommunication]], the term '''work station''' has the following meanings: 

# In automated systems, such as [[computer]], [[communications]], and control systems, the [[input]], [[output]], display, and processing equipment that provides the operator-[[system]] [[interface]]. 
#  A [[computer configuration|configuration]] of input, output, display, and processing equipment that constitutes a stand-alone system not requiring external [[access]].

Source: from [[Federal Standard 1037C]]

