* [[Hans-Jochen Vogel]]
* [[Bernhard Vogel]]
* [[Herbert Grönemeyer]]
* [[Gundula Krause]]
* [[Sandra Nasic]]

==Sports==
Göttingen has:
*a [[goettingen uni cricket club|cricket club]]
*[http://www.bowlingcentergoettingen.de/ bowling alley]
*[http://www.golf.uni-goettingen.de/ driving range] &lt;br&gt;
*at least two skittles alleys.
*[http://www.badeparadies.de/anzeige.html indoor swimming complex] and a number of outdoor pools.

[[Image:Goe.Uni.SUB.detail.03.JPG|thumb|200px|right|University Library SUB]]
