*[[October 3]], [[1990]] - Five East German Ministers - [[Lothar de Maizière]] (CDU), [[Sabine Bergmann-Pohl]] (CDU), Günther Krause (CDU), Rainer Ortleb (FDP), and Hans Joachim Walther ([[German Social Union|DSU]]) - enter the cabinet as Ministers of Special Tasks.
