* http://www.hann.muenden.de/ - Official city homepage
* http://www.hann-muenden.net/ - private homepage, but has much more about Hann. Münden's history.

[[Category:Towns in Lower Saxony]]

[[de:Hann. Münden]]
[[ja:ハン・ミュンデン]]
[[sv:Hannoversch Münden]]</text>
