*[[8 November]] [[1966]] - [[Kurt Schmücker]] succeeds Dahlgrün as Minister of Finance.  [[Werner Dollinger]] (CSU) succeeds Scheel as Minister of Economic Cooperation, remaining also Minister of Federal Treasure.

