* [[1865]], [[July 22]]: Dr. Karl Rudolf Heinze, † [[May 28]] [[1928]] [[Dresden]], [[prime minister]] of [[Saxony]] [[October 26]] to [[November 13]] [[1918]] and Governor of Saxony [[1923]]
