The '''Werra''' is a river in central [[Germany]]. The Werra has its source near [[Fehrenbach]] in [[Thuringia]]. After 293 [[kilometre|km]] the Werra joins the [[Fulda River]] in [[Hann. Münden]], forming the [[Weser]].

