    <title>USS Skate</title>
    <id>42017</id>
    <revision>
      <id>34256537</id>
      <timestamp>2006-01-07T17:16:04Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Gdrbot</username>
        <id>263608</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>gdrbot - replaced {{disambig}} with {{shipindex}} (see discussion at [[Wikipedia talk:WikiProject Ships]])</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">Two [[submarine]]s of the [[United States Navy]] have borne the name '''USS ''Skate''''', named for a type of [[batoidea|ray]].

*The first [[USS Skate (SS-305)|USS ''Skate'' (SS-305)]] was a [[Balao class submarine|&lt;i&gt;Balao&lt;/i&gt;-class submarine]] that saw action in [[World War II]].  
*The second [[USS Skate (SSN-578)|USS ''Skate'' (SSN-578)]], the [[lead ship]] of [[Skate class submarine|her class]] of nuclear attack [[submarine]]s, saw action during the [[Cold War]].

{{shipindex}}

[[Category:United States Navy ship names|Skate]]</text>
    </revision>
